    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/fd/Aranea_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230722133555\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Aranea Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/fd/Aranea_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230722133555\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"896\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Aranea Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Aranea_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSilent shadow(しじまの影 , Shijima no kage)\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA warrior from the hunting tribe than lives deep in the forest. Wearing clothes made from woven fine threads. She hunts in the dark shadows of the forest. When she wields her chain sickle, she resembles a spider spinning webs.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Aranea_SS_Race_Queen_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:81px; top:0.5px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Aranea_SS_Race_Queen_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jp